  "title": "Noli Me Tangere",
  "summary": "José Rizal's novel about Philippine society under Spanish colonial rule was completed in Berlin and printed there. His friend Máximo Viola lent 300 pesos for the cost, and 2,000 copies of the first edition appeared in March 1887. The book satirised the Spanish clergy and the Church's support for colonial abuses.",
